# EXAMPLE - the real file is /etc/mushukistan-ops/uptime.env, owner root, mode 600. Optional.
# The Telegram values are read from /etc/mushukistan-ops/host-health.env (not repeated here).
# Dead-man's switch (healthchecks.io check, period 1 min, grace 5 min). The URL is a secret.
HEALTHCHECK_PING_URL=
# Optional (defaults shown)
# OPS_UPTIME_TIMEOUT=15
# OPS_UPTIME_FAILS_TO_ALERT=2
